{
  "apiVersion": "paseo.sh/workflow/v1",
  "kind": "Workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "字节开发全流程",
  "description": "PRD、技术方案、Agent 指令、开发、Review、BITS 部署、测试和发布的一体化流程。BITS 写操作受显式审批字段保护。",
  "timeoutMs": 86400000,
  "taskDefaults": {
    "timeoutMs": 3600000,
    "retry": {
      "maxAttempts": 2,
      "initialDelayMs": 1000,
      "maxDelayMs": 5000,
      "backoffMultiplier": 2,
      "jitter": true
    }
  },
  "variables": {
    "prd_analysis": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "technical_design": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "agent_instruction": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "development_summary": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "review_summary": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "deploy_summary": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "test_summary": { "type": "string", "default": "" },
    "release_summary": { "type": "string", "default": "" }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "prd",
      "name": "PRD 分析",
      "type": "agent",
      "lifecycle": "single",
      "outputMode": "custom",
      "initialPrompt": "分析下面的 PRD，明确目标、用户价值、范围、非目标、依赖、风险、验收标准和待确认项。内容必须具体、可执行，长度不超过 12000 字符。\n\nPRD 来源：{{origin_input.prd_source}}\nMeego：{{origin_input.meego_url}}\n\nPRD：\n{{origin_input.prd}}\n\n最终只输出一个 JSON 对象：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"prd\",\"summary\":\"完整分析\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"prd_analysis\":\"完整分析\"}}}}。summary 与 prd_analysis 内容保持一致，不要输出 Markdown 代码围栏。",
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "flow_title",
          "projectId",
          "prd",
          "repository_path",
          "agent_provider",
          "agent_model"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "flow_title": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "projectId": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "prd": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "prd_source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["manual", "meego"] },
          "meego_url": { "type": "string" },
          "meego_project_key": { "type": "string" },
          "meego_work_item_id": { "type": "string" },
          "meego_title": { "type": "string" },
          "repository_path": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "agent_provider": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "agent_model": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "approve_development": { "type": "boolean", "default": false },
          "bits_dev_task_id": { "type": "string" },
          "bits_psm": { "type": "string" },
          "bits_project_type": { "type": "string" },
          "bits_phase": { "type": "string" },
          "target_branch": { "type": "string" },
          "control_plane": { "type": "string" },
          "release_ticket_id": { "type": "string" },
          "approve_deploy": { "type": "boolean" },
          "approve_test": { "type": "boolean" },
          "approve_release": { "type": "boolean" },
          "memory_global": { "type": "boolean" },
          "memory_project": { "type": "boolean" },
          "memory_assistant": { "type": "boolean" },
          "assistant_id": { "type": "string" },
          "memory_instructions": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "config": {
        "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
        "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
        "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
        "title": "字节开发 · PRD 分析",
        "archiveOnFinish": false,
        "isolation": "local",
        "approvalPolicy": "never",
        "sandboxMode": "read-only",
        "networkAccess": false,
        "webSearch": false,
        "systemPrompt": "你是资深产品与研发负责人。只分析输入，不修改文件，不执行外部写操作。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "technical_design",
      "name": "技术方案",
      "type": "agent",
      "lifecycle": "single",
      "outputMode": "custom",
      "initialPrompt": "基于 PRD 分析和当前仓库，设计可落地的技术方案。必须检查代码结构和现有约束，覆盖架构、数据模型、接口、兼容性、灰度、监控、回滚、安全、测试与拆分任务。不要修改文件。\n\nPRD 分析：\n{{workflow.var.prd_analysis}}\n\n最终只输出：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"technical_design\",\"summary\":\"完整技术方案\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"technical_design\":\"完整技术方案\"}}}}。内容不超过 12000 字符，不要输出代码围栏。",
      "config": {
        "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
        "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
        "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
        "title": "字节开发 · 技术方案",
        "archiveOnFinish": false,
        "isolation": "local",
        "approvalPolicy": "never",
        "sandboxMode": "read-only",
        "networkAccess": false,
        "webSearch": false,
        "systemPrompt": "你是资深架构师。先阅读仓库再设计，不修改文件。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent_instruction",
      "name": "生成 Agent 指令",
      "type": "agent",
      "lifecycle": "single",
      "outputMode": "custom",
      "initialPrompt": "把 PRD 和技术方案转换为一个开发 Agent 可直接执行的指令。指令要包含目标、约束、修改范围、推荐步骤、禁止事项、验证命令、完成标准和交付清单；要求保留用户已有改动并优先新增文件降低 rebase 冲突。\n\nPRD：\n{{workflow.var.prd_analysis}}\n\n技术方案：\n{{workflow.var.technical_design}}\n\n最终只输出：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"agent_instruction\",\"summary\":\"完整 Agent 指令\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"agent_instruction\":\"完整 Agent 指令\"}}}}。内容不超过 12000 字符，不要输出代码围栏。",
      "config": {
        "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
        "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
        "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
        "title": "字节开发 · Agent 指令",
        "archiveOnFinish": false,
        "isolation": "local",
        "approvalPolicy": "never",
        "sandboxMode": "read-only",
        "networkAccess": false,
        "webSearch": false,
        "systemPrompt": "你是研发任务编排专家。只生成指令，不修改文件。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "development_mode",
      "name": "开发审批",
      "type": "switch",
      "switchVar": "{{origin_input.approve_development}}",
      "cases": [
        {
          "equals": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "development",
              "name": "执行开发",
              "type": "agent",
              "lifecycle": "single",
              "outputMode": "custom",
              "initialPrompt": "严格执行下面的开发指令，在当前仓库完成实现。先检查工作区并保留用户已有改动；优先把新增能力放在新增文件中；运行必要的类型检查和测试；不要提交、推送、部署或发布；不要执行 BITS 写操作。\n\n开发指令：\n{{workflow.var.agent_instruction}}\n\n最终只输出：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"development\",\"summary\":\"修改文件、核心实现、测试结果和遗留风险\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"development_summary\":\"修改文件、核心实现、测试结果和遗留风险\"}}}}。内容不超过 12000 字符，不要输出代码围栏。",
              "retry": { "maxAttempts": 1 },
              "config": {
                "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
                "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
                "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
                "title": "字节开发 · 开发",
                "archiveOnFinish": false,
                "isolation": "local",
                "approvalPolicy": "never",
                "sandboxMode": "workspace-write",
                "networkAccess": true,
                "webSearch": false,
                "systemPrompt": "你是开发执行 Agent。用户已在本次运行中明确允许修改代码，但没有允许提交、推送、部署或发布。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "defaultSteps": [
        {
          "id": "development_plan",
          "name": "开发计划（只读）",
          "type": "agent",
          "lifecycle": "single",
          "outputMode": "custom",
          "initialPrompt": "用户没有授权修改代码。阅读仓库并根据下面指令生成具体开发计划、预期修改文件和验证命令，但不得修改任何文件。\n\n开发指令：\n{{workflow.var.agent_instruction}}\n\n最终只输出：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"development\",\"summary\":\"只读开发计划；未修改代码\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"development_summary\":\"只读开发计划；未修改代码\"}}}}。内容不超过 12000 字符，不要输出代码围栏。",
          "config": {
            "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
            "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
            "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
            "title": "字节开发 · 只读开发计划",
            "archiveOnFinish": false,
            "isolation": "local",
            "approvalPolicy": "never",
            "sandboxMode": "read-only",
            "networkAccess": false,
            "webSearch": false,
            "systemPrompt": "你是只读开发规划 Agent。严禁修改文件。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "name": "代码 Review",
      "type": "agent",
      "lifecycle": "single",
      "outputMode": "custom",
      "initialPrompt": "Review 当前仓库与本次需求相关的改动。优先遵循 bits-code-guard 的审查方法；可只读查询 bytedcli code-review 规则，但不得在 MR 留评论或执行外部写操作。检查正确性、兼容性、安全、并发、错误处理、测试和可维护性。若本次未授权开发，则 Review 技术方案和开发计划的一致性。\n\n技术方案：\n{{workflow.var.technical_design}}\n\n开发结果：\n{{workflow.var.development_summary}}\n\n最终只输出：{\"data\":{\"stage\":\"review\",\"summary\":\"按严重度列出问题、结论和修复建议\"},\"modify\":{\"workflow\":{\"var\":{\"review_summary\":\"按严重度列出问题、结论和修复建议\"}}}}。内容不超过 12000 字符，不要输出代码围栏。",
      "config": {
        "provider": "{{origin_input.agent_provider}}",
        "model": "{{origin_input.agent_model}}",
        "cwd": "{{origin_input.repository_path}}",
        "title": "字节开发 · Review",
        "archiveOnFinish": false,
        "isolation": "local",
        "approvalPolicy": "never",
        "sandboxMode": "read-only",
        "networkAccess": true,
        "webSearch": false,
        "systemPrompt": "你是独立代码审查 Agent。只读审查，不修改代码，不对外写入评论。最终回答必须严格符合用户指定的 Workflow JSON 结果格式。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "deploy",
      "name": "BITS 部署",
      "type": "bash",
      "cwd": "{{workflow.cwd}}/..",
      "initialCommand": "output=\"$(python3 scripts/bits_stage.py deploy <<< \"$input\")\"",
      "inputVariable": "input",
      "outputVariable": "output",
      "retry": { "maxAttempts": 1 },
      "sideEffects": ["bits_deploy"],
      "requiresWriteBack": true
    },
    {
      "id": "test",
      "name": "BITS 测试",
      "type": "bash",
      "cwd": "{{workflow.cwd}}/..",
      "initialCommand": "output=\"$(python3 scripts/bits_stage.py test <<< \"$input\")\"",
      "inputVariable": "input",
      "outputVariable": "output",
      "retry": { "maxAttempts": 1 },
      "sideEffects": ["bits_quick_run"],
      "requiresWriteBack": true
    },
    {
      "id": "release",
      "name": "BITS 发布",
      "type": "bash",
      "cwd": "{{workflow.cwd}}/..",
      "initialCommand": "output=\"$(python3 scripts/bits_stage.py release <<< \"$input\")\"",
      "inputVariable": "input",
      "outputVariable": "output",
      "retry": { "maxAttempts": 1 },
      "sideEffects": ["bits_publish"],
      "requiresWriteBack": true
    },
    {
      "id": "finalize",
      "name": "汇总与记忆",
      "type": "python",
      "module": "scripts.finalize",
      "function": "run_node",
      "cwd": "{{workflow.cwd}}/..",
      "inputVariable": "input",
      "outputVariable": "output",
      "retry": { "maxAttempts": 1 }
    }
  ]
}
